[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_08050000_00_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_08050000_00_0010","text":"……路加酱喜欢什么零食呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_08050000_00_0020","text":"……诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_08050000_00_0030","text":"我想着准备路加酱喜欢的零食，\n她应该会高兴的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_08050000_00_0040","text":"原来如此……\n路加会喜欢的零食啊──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_08050000_00_0004","text":"和果子\n之类的吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_08050000_00_0005","text":"蛋糕怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_08050000_00_0006","text":"月饼之类的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_08050000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_08050000_01_0010","text":"诶——？嗯——……感觉更酷一点的东西\n才符合路加酱的形象吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_08050000_01_0020","text":"…………哈？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_08050000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_08050000_02_0010","text":"确实——！什么样的蛋糕好呢？\n巧克力之类的……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_08050000_02_0020","text":"………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_08050000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_08050000_03_0010","text":"诶，好意外的选项——！\n路加酱……会喜欢吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_08050000_03_0020","text":"…………啊？"}]
